  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Systems Approach to Disease Resistance Against Necrotrophic Fungal Pathogens</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will help increase increasing resistance of lettuce to both Botrytis cinerea and Sclerotinia sclerotiorum, two important fungal pathogens.  This will result in significant economic gains for both growers and breeders as well as environmental benefits.</narrative>
  </description>
